      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ARE WEASLEY (3) found form and finished in the money two runs ago then came back to earth when he was interfered with and broke last time, finishing 30 metres back in eighth over 2240m at Melton. No excuses from this more advantageous draw. Won't find this any harder so he can return to form. CLIVES GIRL (2) is in good form at present. Finished fifth at her latest appearance over 1690m at this track, beaten 9 metres. Meets a comparable field and she can find winning ways. WINGATE GUY (6) is better than his last-start eighth over 2190m at this track. Worth another chance. MISS HERMES (4) could only finish seventh over 2190m at this circuit most recently. Open to improvement and is in the mix from the front line draw.",
